# Memory Bank

After each session reset, follow the selective discovery sequence in root `AGENTS.md` — not the entire Memory Bank or documentation tree.

## Default discovery sequence

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `docs/VSSYL_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`
3. Inspect actual task-relevant code
4. Use `docs/architecture/VSSYL_ARCHITECTURE_INDEX.md` to locate canonical architecture
5. Load relevant scoped `.cursor/rules`
6. Load targeted Memory Bank product context only when relevant
7. Load `memory-bank/activeContext.md` / `memory-bank/progress.md` only when current workstream status, recent implementation history, sequencing, or unfinished work is materially relevant

Do **not** make `activeContext.md` or `progress.md` universal baseline reads.

## Expand by task (targeted reads only)

| Task | Also read |
|------|-----------|
| Module / feature | `memory-bank/*ProductContext.md`, `memory-bank/moduleSpecs.md` when product intent matters |
| Architecture / cross-cutting | Canonical docs via `docs/architecture/VSSYL_ARCHITECTURE_INDEX.md` first; Memory Bank patterns only as supporting product context |
| Database | `memory-bank/databaseContext.md` when product/data intent matters; Prisma rules + schema otherwise |
| Deploy / ops | `docs/deployment/` (and `memory-bank/deployment.md` only if product/ops status context is needed) |
| AI architecture | `docs/architecture/AI_SYSTEM_MENTAL_MODEL.md`, `AI_READING_GUIDE.md`, `AI_DOCUMENT_STATUS_MATRIX.md` — not archived `docs/archive/session-summaries/AI_PLATFORM_PHASED_PLAN.md` as current authority |

Do **not** read all 50+ Memory Bank files unless the user requests a full **update memory bank** refresh (then prioritize `activeContext.md` and `progress.md` for that refresh only).

## After major changes

Update Memory Bank status/progress as appropriate when the change affects current workstream status. Archive superseded docs per `docs/VSSYL_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`.

## Where to write new documentation

**Placement policy:** `docs/guides/DOCUMENTATION_PLACEMENT.md` and `.cursor/rules/RULES_SUMMARY.md`.

- **Agent orientation** → root `AGENTS.md`
- **Product intent / status** → `memory-bank/`
- **Agent executable constraints** → `.cursor/rules/` (short)
- **Architecture** → `docs/architecture/`
- **How-to / onboarding** → `docs/guides/`

